<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GovFund - Government Scheme Portal</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #2c3e50;
            --accent-color: #27ae60;
            --bg-color: #f8f9fa;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #333333;
            --text-light: #666666;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Container for the entire content */
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        /* Top 3 Schemes Grid */
        .top-schemes-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        /* Base styles for the square cards */
        .square-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-main);
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px; /* Forces the square shape */
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .square-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .square-card h2 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .square-card p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .rank-badge {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* Making the 1st scheme (Middle) slightly larger to emphasize it */
        .rank-1 {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            z-index: 2;
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
        }
        
        .rank-1:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1) translateY(-5px);
        }

        /* Section Title for the List */
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* List Layout for remaining schemes */
        .list-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .list-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);
        }

        .list-item:hover {
            background-color: #f1f8f5;
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .list-item-content h3 {
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .list-item-content p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Responsive design for smaller screens */
        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            .top-schemes-wrapper {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .rank-1 {
                transform: scale(1);
                order: -1; /* Puts the 1st rank at the top on mobile */
            }
            .square-card {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 300px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>GovFund Portal</h1>
        <p>Empowering Your Business and Farming Goals with Government Support</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <!-- TOP 3 SCHEMES -->
        <!-- Order in HTML: Rank 2 (Left), Rank 1 (Middle), Rank 3 (Right) -->
        <div class="top-schemes-wrapper">
            
            <!-- 2nd Rank (Left) -->
            <a href="https://www.standupmitra.in/" target="_blank" class="square-card rank-2">
                <div class="rank-badge">2</div>
                <h2>Stand-Up India</h2>
                <p>Loans from ₹10 lakh to ₹1 crore for SC/ST and women entrepreneurs.</p>
            </a>

            <!-- 1st Rank (Middle) - Emphasized with .rank-1 class -->
            <a href="https://www.mudra.org.in/" target="_blank" class="square-card rank-1">
                <div class="rank-badge">1</div>
                <h2>PM MUDRA Yojana</h2>
                <p>Micro-credit up to ₹10 lakh for non-corporate, non-farm small/micro enterprises.</p>
            </a>

            <!-- 3rd Rank (Right) -->
            <a href="https://www.kviconline.gov.in/pmegpeportal/pmegphome/index.jsp" target="_blank" class="square-card rank-3">
                <div class="rank-badge">3</div>
                <h2>PMEGP Scheme</h2>
                <p>Credit-linked subsidy program for generating employment in rural and urban areas.</p>
            </a>

        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">More Government Loan Schemes</h2>

        <!-- SCROLLABLE LIST OF REMAINING SCHEMES -->
        <div class="list-container">
            
            <a href="https://pmkisan.gov.in/" target="_blank" class="list-item">
                <div class="list-item-content">
                    <h3>4. Kisan Credit Card (KCC)</h3>
                    <p>Provides farmers with timely access to credit for agricultural and allied expenses.</p>
                </div>
            </a>

            <a href="https://www.cgtmse.in/" target="_blank" class="list-item">
                <div class="list-item-content">
                    <h3>5. CGTMSE Scheme</h3>
                    <p>Collateral-free credit support to Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs).</p>
                </div>
            </a>

            <a href="https://pmsvanidhi.mohua.gov.in/" target="_blank" class="list-item">
                <div class="list-item-content">
                    <h3>6. PM SVANidhi</h3>
                    <p>Special micro-credit facility for street vendors to resume their livelihoods.</p>
                </div>
            </a>

            <a href="https://agriinfra.dac.gov.in/" target="_blank" class="list-item">
                <div class="list-item-content">
                    <h3>7. Agriculture Infrastructure Fund</h3>
                    <p>Medium to long-term debt financing for post-harvest management infrastructure.</p>
                </div>
            </a>

            <a href="https://nsfdc.nic.in/" target="_blank" class="list-item">
                <div class="list-item-content">
                    <h3>8. NSFDC Loan Schemes</h3>
                    <p>Financial assistance for the economic empowerment of Scheduled Castes.</p>
                </div>
            </a>

        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
